## intro
Tonight is the Thanksgiving party.
Difficulty: Normal.
The case: Chiaotzu was found knocked out in the Conservatory and is in the regeneration pod in the Infirmary upstairs, memory gone.
Accomplices: one guest did it, and another covered for them: the two swear they were together somewhere else at the time, and each names the other. A story only its partner backs up is worth a second look. Jaco wants both names.
You have one hour before the case closes itself. Leaving the house or quitting closes it too.
Twelve people were at the party: Yamcha, Yajirobe, Emperor Pilaf, Mai, Mr. Satan, Tien, Gohan, Piccolo, Krillin, Android 18, Chi-Chi and Dende.
The house clock chimed four times that night, at nine, ten, eleven and midnight. Every story is told by those times.
Where to start:
 1. Read your tablet: notebook. It lists every lead and where to go next.
 2. inspect victim in the Infirmary for the injury and the time.
