## confront
Emperor Pilaf sees a crayon plan to steal the Dragon Radar and goes pale. "It was a plan. A drawing of a plan. Not a crime."
"So that is where I really was:"
At ten: "In the Menagerie Yard, with Yamcha and Gohan. Plotting nothing. Nothing at all!"
Piccolo sees a failed driving test with Piccolo's name on it and goes pale. "The instructor was afraid of me. That is not my fault."
"So that is where I really was:"
At nine: "In the Grand Hall, with Yajirobe and Dende. Hmph."
Mai sees a pamphlet called Learn to Dance in 3 Days and goes pale. "I was practicing. Alone. Do not tell Pilaf."
"I was never in the Dining Room with Emperor Pilaf. They asked me to say we were together, and I covered for them."
"So that is where I really was:"
At ten: "In the Study, with Krillin and Dende. I had my eye on everyone."
Mr. Satan sees a ghost proof vest, size XXL and goes pale. "A spider got in. The champ was regrouping."
"So that is where I really was:"
At ten: "In the Menagerie Yard, with Yamcha and Gohan. Everyone saw me. Everyone always does!"
