## accuse
Accuse in one line, anywhere in the house:
  accuse <suspect> and <suspect> with <weapon> at <time>
Both names, in either order: who did it and who covered for them.
Suspects: yamcha yajirobe pilaf mai
          satan tien gohan piccolo
Weapons:  gauntlet jacket lights
          dream hornets taser
Times:    nine ten eleven midnight (or 9 to 12)
Example:  accuse yajirobe and gohan with dream at ten
Short:    accuse yajirobe gohan dream 10
Then accuse yes makes the arrest.
